    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start on the differentiators. I noticed in the 2018 patent (US2018/098765) they also mentioned using a micro-lattice structure to manage heat. Do you think the examiner is going to flag that as being too similar to Zephyr's approach? I want to make sure we have a really airtight argument to prevent them from rejecting it based on that specific lattice design.",
